description:
Checks cover eval/fmt/shellcheck only. Add cheap checks and assertions for:
- `inventory.nix` keys versus permanent `nixosConfigurations` (bootstrap excluded);
- every `hosts/*.nix` referenced by the flake;
- `modules/lib.nix` `cidrToNetwork` cases, including /0, /32, and invalid input;
- `extraPeers` requires a fixed `listenPort`;
- `vpn.dnsZone` requires `dnsAddress` (currently silently skipped in modules/incus/runtime.nix);
- `dns.enable` requires `coredns` or `incusPrimary`;
- `vpn.enable` requires WireGuard;
- docs references to local repo paths resolve.

The sops-recipient check is already homelab-8ar.4 and is out of scope here.

Source: flake.nix:146-197, modules/wireguard.nix:66-77, modules/incus/runtime.nix:76-79.
